  "description_snippet": "## VULNERABILITY DETAILS\n\n### Summary\n\nA V8 sandbox bypass on **arm64**: the builtin helper `Generate_PushBoundArguments()` reads `JSBoundFunction::[[BoundArguments]]` (a `FixedArray`) and **untags its `length_` as a signed value** without validating it is non-negative. Attacker can set `FixedArray."
